requirement_id: "REQ-impl-native-frame"
reason: "Clause-scoped mapped-region, full-width access, permission, alias, spill/reload, reachable-successor, return-context, ownership and refusal examples support the conditional native frame checker, including seven default-optimized field kernels. Complete invariant evidence across all four clauses remains outstanding: the bounded access and spill fuzz grammars and sampled concrete byte-memory oracle, which shares instruction decoding, do not establish the complete accepted region/interface, instruction-effect, call/primitive refusal and composition-boundary conjunction. Calls, syscalls, loops, PUSH/POP and unresolved forms deliberately refuse. This is an uncovered evidence obligation, not a demonstrated implementation contradiction; the local frame establishes neither source-layout correspondence, ordinary-Go lifting, clock/vDSO or harness semantics nor runtime-reuse authority."
content_hash: "fc289b43666044f9b054c0e6597d3466e6e3db521a25ea280ec799a3bfe7a908"
