lands { manual { condition: "tooling-redesign 5.1w.2b.3b.3: establish complete conditional native-frame invariant evidence for the supported byte-region and instruction model, including explicit memory lifetimes and aliases, actual image permissions, full-width bounds and checked arithmetic, byte-level pointer provenance under overlapping writes, every reachable successor, original return context, protected state, immutable dependencies and bounded/cancelled refusal. Discharge actual-use, ordinary-Go lifting/suspension and harness premises separately in this same composition slot; selected callee and primitive frame extensions remain at 5.1w.3b, with producing/current/historical applicability at 5.1w.2b.4." } }
excuses: GAP_EXCUSE_UNCOVERED
